<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<LanguageData>

  <!-- EN: Draw the surrounding air in through the respirator for a few seconds. Smoke, tox gas and other gases near the pilot will be pulled in and cleared, even as they move. If a tank is worn, whatever is drawn in will be filtered and stored in it as tox gas. -->
  <TXWC_AbsorbGas.description>駕駛員用呼吸器吸入周圍空氣數秒。駕駛員附近的煙霧、毒氣和其他氣體，即使在移動，也會被吸入並清除。若穿戴了毒氣罐，吸入的氣體會經過濾，以毒氣的形式存入罐中。</TXWC_AbsorbGas.description>
  <!-- EN: Using ability: {0} -->
  <TXWC_AbsorbGas.jobReportString>使用能力：{0}</TXWC_AbsorbGas.jobReportString>
  <!-- EN: absorb gas -->
  <TXWC_AbsorbGas.label>吸收氣體</TXWC_AbsorbGas.label>
  <!-- EN: absorb gas -->
  <TXWC_AbsorbGas.verbProperties.label>吸收氣體</TXWC_AbsorbGas.verbProperties.label>

  <!-- EN: Open the tank's vents and release tox gas around the pilot. The cloud will grow from wherever the pilot stands and follow them as they move. Toggle again to close the vents and keep what is left. -->
  <TXWC_VentTank.description>打開毒氣罐的排氣口，在駕駛員周圍釋放毒氣。毒雲會從駕駛員所在處擴散，並隨其移動。再次切換即可關閉排氣口，保留剩餘的毒氣。</TXWC_VentTank.description>
  <!-- EN: Using ability: {0} -->
  <TXWC_VentTank.jobReportString>使用能力：{0}</TXWC_VentTank.jobReportString>
  <!-- EN: vent tank -->
  <TXWC_VentTank.label>排放毒氣</TXWC_VentTank.label>
  <!-- EN: vent tank -->
  <TXWC_VentTank.verbProperties.label>排放毒氣</TXWC_VentTank.verbProperties.label>

</LanguageData>
